- Hit three-dots on the right-hand side to Download ZIP
- Unzip and navigate in
- Right-click on Run.bat and select "Run as Administrator"
-----

* Make sure you check every item specified in `DeBloatW11.ps1`, and feel free to remove any items you would like to keep.
* If you get execution policy errors, run
> Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope CurrentUser